{"kind":"html","caption":"用二维动态规划表示两个前缀的最长公共子序列长度：字符相同时取左上角加 1，不同时取上方与左侧的较大值。动画按行填充示例 `abcde` 与 `ace` 的表格，并高亮当前格及其依赖；右下角最终得到 3，对应公共子序列 `ace`。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>最长公共子序列动态规划</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .mono, .value, .char, .formula { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .strings { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 11px; }\n  .string-label { color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .string-value { padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 10px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .swatch { width: 10px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 2px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .swatch.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .swatch.dependency { background: #353f4a; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 4px; }\n  .cell { min-height: 44px; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; transition: background .25s, border-color .25s; }\n  .cell.header { min-height: 32px; background: #2d2d30; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 11px; }\n  .cell.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .cell.dependency { background: #353f4a; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.path { background: #103b5b; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .coordinate { color: #8d8d8d; font-size:10px; line-height: 1.2; }\n  .value { align-self: center; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .unknown { color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .status { margin-top: 6px; min-height: auto; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .step-title { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .comparison { margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 12px; }\n  .formula { color: #3794ff; font-size: 11px; word-break: break-word; }\n  .result { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .answer { color: #3794ff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .progress { margin-top: 6px; height: 3px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 4px; background: #3c3c3c; }\n  .progress-bar { height: 100%; width: 0; background: #3794ff; transition: width .25s linear; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>二维表记录两个前缀的最优答案</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\"><span class=\"mono\">dp[i][j]</span> 表示 <span class=\"mono\">text1[0..i)</span> 与 <span class=\"mono\">text2[0..j)</span> 的最长公共子序列长度。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"strings\">\n      <div class=\"string-item\"><span class=\"string-label\">纵向 text1</span><span class=\"string-value\">abcde</span></div>\n      <div class=\"string-item\"><span class=\"string-label\">横向 text2</span><span class=\"string-value\">ace</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch current\"></span><span>当前计算</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch dependency\"></span><span>依赖的旧状态</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch\"></span><span>已完成状态</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"step-title\" id=\"stepTitle\">初始化边界</div>\n      <div class=\"comparison\" id=\"comparison\">任意字符串与空串的公共子序列长度都是 0。</div>\n      <div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\">dp[0][j] = dp[i][0] = 0</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progressBar\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"result\">最终读取右下角：<span class=\"answer\" id=\"answer\">?</span>。匹配字符沿对角线依次为 <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:#fff\">a → c → e</span>，得到最长公共子序列 <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:#3794ff\">ace</span>。</div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const a = 'abcde';\n  const b = 'ace';\n  const rows = a.length + 1;\n  const cols = b.length + 1;\n  const dp = Array.from({ length: rows }, () => Array(cols).fill(0));\n  const steps = [];\n\n  for (let i = 1; i < rows; i++) {\n    for (let j = 1; j < cols; j++) {\n      const same = a[i - 1] === b[j - 1];\n      dp[i][j] = same ? dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1 : Math.max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]);\n      steps.push({ i, j, same, value: dp[i][j] });\n    }\n  }\n\n  const grid = document.getElementById('grid');\n  const title = document.getElementById('stepTitle');\n  const comparison = document.getElementById('comparison');\n  const formula = document.getElementById('formula');\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progressBar');\n  const cells = new Map();\n\n  function key(i, j) { return i + ',' + j; }\n\n  function makeCell(className, coordinate, value) {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = className;\n    if (coordinate !== '') {\n      const small = document.createElement('div');\n      small.className = 'coordinate';\n      small.textContent = coordinate;\n      cell.appendChild(small);\n    }\n    const main = document.createElement('div');\n    main.className = 'value';\n    main.textContent = value;\n    cell.appendChild(main);\n    return cell;\n  }\n\n  function buildGrid() {\n    grid.appendChild(makeCell('cell header', '', ''));\n    grid.appendChild(makeCell('cell header', '', '∅'));\n    for (let j = 1; j < cols; j++) grid.appendChild(makeCell('cell header', '', b[j - 1]));\n    for (let i = 0; i < rows; i++) {\n      const label = i === 0 ? '∅' : a[i - 1];\n      grid.appendChild(makeCell('cell header', '', label));\n      for (let j = 0; j < cols; j++) {\n        const initial = (i === 0 || j === 0) ? '0' : '·';\n        const cell = makeCell('cell', 'dp[' + i + '][' + j + ']', initial);\n        if (initial === '·') cell.querySelector('.value').classList.add('unknown');\n        cells.set(key(i, j), cell);\n        grid.appendChild(cell);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  function resetClasses() {\n    cells.forEach(cell => cell.classList.remove('current', 'dependency', 'path'));\n  }\n\n  function setValue(i, j, value, known) {\n    const cell = cells.get(key(i, j));\n    if (!cell) return;\n    const valueNode = cell.querySelector('.value');\n    valueNode.textContent = value;\n    valueNode.classList.toggle('unknown', !known);\n  }\n\n  function render(stepIndex) {\n    resetClasses();\n    for (let i = 1; i < rows; i++) {\n      for (let j = 1; j < cols; j++) setValue(i, j, '·', false);\n    }\n\n    if (stepIndex < 0) {\n      title.textContent = '初始化边界';\n      comparison.textContent = '任意字符串与空串的公共子序列长度都是 0。';\n      formula.textContent = 'dp[0][j] = dp[i][0] = 0';\n      answer.textContent = '?';\n      progress.style.width = '0%';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    for (let k = 0; k <= stepIndex && k < steps.length; k++) {\n      const done = steps[k];\n      setValue(done.i, done.j, String(done.value), true);\n    }\n\n    if (stepIndex >= steps.length) {\n      [key(1,1), key(3,2), key(5,3)].forEach(k => cells.get(k).classList.add('path'));\n      title.textContent = '表格填充完成';\n      comparison.textContent = '右下角覆盖两个完整字符串，数值就是题目所求。';\n      formula.textContent = 'dp[5][3] = 3，最长公共子序列为 ace';\n      answer.textContent = '3';\n      progress.style.width = '100%';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const s = steps[stepIndex];\n    const current = cells.get(key(s.i, s.j));\n    current.classList.add('current');\n    const leftChar = a[s.i - 1];\n    const topChar = b[s.j - 1];\n\n    if (s.same) {\n      cells.get(key(s.i - 1, s.j - 1)).classList.add('dependency');\n      title.textContent = '第 ' + (stepIndex + 1) + ' 步：字符相同';\n      comparison.textContent = '比较 “' + leftChar + '” 与 “' + topChar + '”：相同，可以把这个字符接到已有子序列之后。';\n      formula.textContent = 'dp[' + s.i + '][' + s.j + '] = dp[' + (s.i - 1) + '][' + (s.j - 1) + '] + 1 = ' + s.value;\n    } else {\n      cells.get(key(s.i - 1, s.j)).classList.add('dependency');\n      cells.get(key(s.i, s.j - 1)).classList.add('dependency');\n      title.textContent = '第 ' + (stepIndex + 1) + ' 步：字符不同';\n      comparison.textContent = '比较 “' + leftChar + '” 与 “' + topChar + '”：不同，分别尝试忽略一个字符并保留较优结果。';\n      formula.textContent = 'dp[' + s.i + '][' + s.j + '] = max(dp[' + (s.i - 1) + '][' + s.j + '], dp[' + s.i + '][' + (s.j - 1) + ']) = ' + s.value;\n    }\n    answer.textContent = stepIndex === steps.length - 1 ? '3' : '?';\n    progress.style.width = ((stepIndex + 1) / (steps.length + 1) * 100) + '%';\n  }\n\n  buildGrid();\n  let frame = -1;\n  render(frame);\n  setInterval(function () {\n    frame++;\n    if (frame > steps.length) frame = -1;\n    render(frame);\n  }, 1800);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
